i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M8ttp1g6OnoQ7kNvwGWFxwr&_nc_oc=AdqvISXiO8QozOn4xWBmlW9BJJ9gvcf4zE5gbBYV8RSI1ewRS8RYiOpmztCyD9vpqfM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRAJY8dV78D3d8GFfZzQZjW-1V95uXRW8rFiNNSJD1XpA&oe=6AF0ACE3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8q7pTlCMpToQ7kNvwGG5r7R&_nc_oc=Adpocn9M14T6MXshXDAch_1ZW3kN1fDG5Iig99Dece6OOwsbIcE2n4_dpeUAXsjiLJE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQxANHp43F7JWVyWf-JbqNTt4w3O4IbBIxCPmBWaxrYDA&oe=6AF098DD"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bpo9hK8Y2z8Q7kNvwFp06N6&_nc_oc=AdoMx97sifz61o07VfNPiCbij0z2Y4kvkLO7HaHEmySaVQWz3i8OrJkQfKMLwwvsulw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQSoM-0miGTUTNOLOQEqWXuEGe33WQlOJ_kelEWjUbriA&oe=6AF0874A"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im